{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>תקימו</b> — twice in the Masorah: תקימו את האבנים (\"you shall set up the stones\"); ופסל ומצבה לא תקימו (\"a sculptured stone and a pillar you shall not set up\"). Corresponding to what I commanded you — לא תקימו (\"you shall not set up\") — I command you: תקימו את האבנים (\"you shall set up the stones\")."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:46.668617279Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}